      "title": "Putin hails Elon Musk’s ‘genius’ amid plans for Russian version of Starlink",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/28/vladimir-putin-elon-musk-genius-russia-starlink",
      "description": "<p>Russia plans to build own version of US billionaire’s satellite communications to help attack Ukraine</p><p>Vladimir Putin praised Elon Musk’s genius and said he was in touch with Starlink’s controlling shareholder as Russia develops its own satellite communications for its military to use against Ukraine.</p><p>The Russian president, speaking at a summit with African leaders in Moscow, was comparing the Earth-orbiting network built by Musk’s SpaceX with Russia’s gradual efforts to build its own Rassvet constellation.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/28/vladimir-putin-elon-musk-genius-russia-starlink\">Continue reading...</a>",
